WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.200
Dwelling in the sukkah includes required meals

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:05.800
and sleep, subject to exemptions.

00:00:06.430 --> 00:00:08.700
Link your meal preparation to entering the

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:13.260
sukkah, creating a reliable queue for the

00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:13.780
mitzvah.
